<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[subpath1]/[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><section id="become-a-courier-faqs" class="page-header page-header--standard" index="0" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__container" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__content" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__text-content" data-v-93adf07f><!----><h1 class="page-header__title" data-v-93adf07f>Become a Courier FAQs</h1><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Got a question about becoming an Evri courier? Find what you need in our comprehensive FAQs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="page-header__media" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__media-text-image" data-v-93adf07f><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2c2f87c2-2598-431c-b652-645b0d7b4eaf_faq.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2c2f87c2-2598-431c-b652-645b0d7b4eaf_faq.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2c2f87c2-2598-431c-b652-645b0d7b4eaf_faq.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2c2f87c2-2598-431c-b652-645b0d7b4eaf_faq.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="FAQ" width="300" height="103" class="page-header__text-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-93adf07f></div></div></div><!----></section><div id="most-popular" class="accordion accordion--neutral-02" index="1" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h3 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Most popular</h3><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>I’m having problems submitting my application. What should I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you are using Internet Explorer, please try a different browser or use your mobile phone. If you continue to experience problems, please email <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:courier.recruitment@evri.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->courier.recruitment@evri.com<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What are the working hours for the role?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier, working hours can be really flexible depending on a number of factors such as your availability, the location of your round, and the number of parcels that particular round generates. On average, a courier works approximately 5-6 hours a day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How will I be paid?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers are paid on a monthly basis via BACS. All payments made by Evri to the courier will be without deductions of things like income tax, for which you are responsible. Invoices are accessible through the dedicated link in the Courier Community App.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I need additional insurance?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier, you must have the correct level of 3rd party cover whilst you’re out making deliveries. Evri has developed a ‘top-up’ insurance with a leading global insurance company. Charged at £1.35 per day and only on the days that service is provided to Evri, this gives the 3rd party cover required for self-employed couriers whilst making deliveries and collections on behalf of Evri our clients. (Full details can be provided upon request.)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I apply using a non-UK driving licence?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="caniapplyusinganonukdrivinglicence-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes, any person with a valid driving licence issued in their country of origin is permitted to drive in the United Kingdom for at least 12 months. This includes driving in the UK with an EU licence. After this period, you will need to exchange your documents for a UK licence or pass the DVSA’s UK driving test. As a self-employed courier with Evri, it is your own responsibility to ensure that your driving licence is valid whilst providing service.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!----></div></div></div><div id="delivery" class="accordion accordion--neutral-02" index="2" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h3 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Delivery</h3><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whocandeliverforevri-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whocandeliverforevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whocandeliverforevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whocandeliverforevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whocandeliverforevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Who can deliver for Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whocandeliverforevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whocandeliverforevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whocandeliverforevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You are eligible to apply to be a self-employed courier with Evri if you have a full, valid driving licence, own (or have access to) a car or van with a valid MOT and insurance, have the right to work in the UK and have no unspent criminal convictions.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatwillideliver-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatwillideliver" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatwillideliver" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatwillideliver-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatwillideliver-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What will I deliver?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatwillideliver" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatwillideliver" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatwillideliver-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Most of the items you will deliver are from online retailers and vary in size and weight. Nothing will exceed 17kg unless we agree on this with you separately. Some of our clients do send alcohol/products that contain alcohol through our network.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How am I kept up to date with any recent developments?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howamikeptuptodatewithanyrecentdevelopments-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Communications and updates are shared in the information library of the Courier Community App, along with weekly email updates. You can of course also contact your dedicated Community Delivery Manager anytime.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How will I get the parcels I am due to deliver?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howwilligettheparcelsiamduetodeliver-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In most cases, you will collect the parcels yourself from a Delivery Unit local to you. If you live in a remote rural location, we may drop the parcels off with you via Solus Drop – this would be discussed with you beforehand.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do all parcels have to be delivered the same day?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doallparcelshavetobedeliveredthesameday-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It won’t always be possible to successfully deliver a parcel to a customer, a neighbour, or a safe location on the first day, but delivery should always be attempted for all items on the same day you take receipt of them.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What do I do with parcels that I am not able to deliver?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatdoidowithparcelsthatiamnotabletodeliver-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You will need to record the reason for non-delivery on your device and then store the items in a secure place overnight to re-attempt them the following day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!----></div></div></div><div id="vehicle" class="accordion accordion--neutral-02" index="3" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h3 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Vehicle</h3><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="doigetpaidforfuelormileage-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doigetpaidforfuelormileage" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doigetpaidforfuelormileage" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="doigetpaidforfuelormileage-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doigetpaidforfuelormileage-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I get paid for fuel or mileage?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doigetpaidforfuelormileage" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doigetpaidforfuelormileage" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doigetpaidforfuelormileage-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier, this is one of the costs you would cover yourself. You can, however, claim fuel expenses for journeys by using either the flat-rate mileage allowance (simplified expenses) or by claiming actual fuel costs based on records. Find out more here: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://www.gov.uk/expenses-if-youre-self-employed/travel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->https://www.gov.uk/expenses-if-youre-self-employed/travel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whattypeofvehicledoineed-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whattypeofvehicledoineed" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whattypeofvehicledoineed" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whattypeofvehicledoineed-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whattypeofvehicledoineed-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What type of vehicle do I need?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whattypeofvehicledoineed" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whattypeofvehicledoineed" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whattypeofvehicledoineed-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Any reasonably sized, make or model of vehicle is acceptable as long as it is reliable and has a valid MOT and insurance.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="caniuseahirecarorvan-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-caniuseahirecarorvan" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-caniuseahirecarorvan" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="caniuseahirecarorvan-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="caniuseahirecarorvan-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I use a hire car or van?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-caniuseahirecarorvan" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-caniuseahirecarorvan" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="caniuseahirecarorvan-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->While couriers do need their own transport, there is no requirement for couriers to own their vehicles. However, the vehicle must have a valid MOT, and the courier must have insurance in place that covers them to carry out courier work.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!----></div></div></div><div id="being-a-courier" class="accordion accordion--neutral-02" index="4" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h3 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Being a courier</h3><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatdoihavetowear-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatdoihavetowear" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatdoihavetowear" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatdoihavetowear-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatdoihavetowear-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What do I have to wear?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatdoihavetowear" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatdoihavetowear" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatdoihavetowear-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Any smart, comfortable clothing is acceptable, but <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->optional <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri-branded clothing is also available to purchase as part of the Evri Partner Rewards at really affordable prices. (Full details can be provided upon request.)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="howmanydaysamirequiredtowork-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howmanydaysamirequiredtowork" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howmanydaysamirequiredtowork" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="howmanydaysamirequiredtowork-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howmanydaysamirequiredtowork-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How many days am I required to work?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howmanydaysamirequiredtowork" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howmanydaysamirequiredtowork" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howmanydaysamirequiredtowork-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The beauty of being self-employed is that it’s completely up to you! You can provide a delivery service between 1 and 7 days a week, depending on what you negotiate and agree with us. However, should you wish to become an Evri Plus courier and get enhanced contractual benefits, you&#39;ll need to commit to five or more days a week, including a Saturday or Sunday. Find out whether Evri Flex or Evri Plus is right for you <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/be-a-courier" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->here.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatistheholidayentitlement-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatistheholidayentitlement" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatistheholidayentitlement" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatistheholidayentitlement-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatistheholidayentitlement-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What is the holiday entitlement?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatistheholidayentitlement" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatistheholidayentitlement" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatistheholidayentitlement-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier, you are not under any obligation to provide services personally. You have the unconditional right to use a substitute to provide service on your behalf when you want to go on holiday.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I need to have background checks to provide service for Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedtohavebackgroundcheckstoprovideserviceforevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You are not required to provide a DBS certificate before starting to provide service with Evri; we may request one, and if requested, it is a requirement to provide this to us.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="areratesofpaynegotiable-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-areratesofpaynegotiable" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-areratesofpaynegotiable" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="areratesofpaynegotiable-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="areratesofpaynegotiable-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Are rates of pay negotiable?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-areratesofpaynegotiable" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-areratesofpaynegotiable" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="areratesofpaynegotiable-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All couriers can seek to negotiate their rate of pay. Note that couriers on a self-employed plus contract are guaranteed at least the minimum wage.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="caniarrangecoverforholidays-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-caniarrangecoverforholidays" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-caniarrangecoverforholidays" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="caniarrangecoverforholidays-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="caniarrangecoverforholidays-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I arrange cover for holidays?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-caniarrangecoverforholidays" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-caniarrangecoverforholidays" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="caniarrangecoverforholidays-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You are able to arrange suitable cover for any holiday you might take.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What are the benefits of being a courier with Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatarethebenefitsofbeingacourierwithevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers can access benefits such as discounts on technology, vehicles, and business products free of charge. For an annual subscription of £15, couriers can access more rewards, such as discounts on family days out, cinema and restaurants.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Am I responsible for processing my own taxes?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="amiresponsibleforprocessingmyowntaxes-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers are self-employed and therefore will need to process their own taxes. Contact the HMRC for guidance, or advice can be found at <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://www.which.co.uk/money/tax/income-tax/income-tax-for-the-self-employed/paying-tax-self-employed-a7gzb4c1wucx" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Paying tax: self-employed<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!----></div></div></div><div id="courier-community-app" class="accordion accordion--neutral-02" index="5" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h3 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Courier Community App</h3><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>I can’t login to the courier community app, what should I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="icantlogintothecouriercommunityappwhatshouldido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you&#39;re having trouble accessing your account, please try these troubleshooting steps: <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br>1) <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check Your Credentials:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Ensure there are no typos in your email or password. Double-check that <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Caps Lock<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> is off and there are no extra spaces at the end of your entry. <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br>2) <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Reset Your Password:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Click the <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->&quot;Forgot Password?&quot;<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> link on the login screen to receive a reset link via email or SMS. If you don&#39;t see the email, check your <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Spam/Junk<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> folder. <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br>3) <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Update the App:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Visit the Google Play Store or Apple App Store to ensure you are using the <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->latest version<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> of the app. <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br>4) <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Restart &amp; Reconnect:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Toggle your <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Airplane Mode<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> on and off to refresh your data connection, or try switching from Wi-Fi to mobile data. <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br>5) <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Clear Cache (Android Only):<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Go to your phone&#39;s <!--]--><!--]--><em><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Evri Courier App &gt; Storage<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></em><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and select <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->&quot;Clear Cache.&quot;<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--[--><br><!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Still can&#39;t get in?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--[--><br>Your account may be under review or temporarily suspended. Please contact our  Courier Support Team with a screenshot of any error message you receive. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What do I do if my app is disabled?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatdoidoifmyappisdisabled-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your app has been disabled because you either chose to stop delivering with us or were removed from our system. If you resigned voluntarily and want to return, simply reapply to restore your access. However, if your contract was terminated by us, you are not eligible to rejoin or regain access to the app.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="wherecanifindguidanceonthedeliveryapp-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-wherecanifindguidanceonthedeliveryapp" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-wherecanifindguidanceonthedeliveryapp" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="wherecanifindguidanceonthedeliveryapp-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="wherecanifindguidanceonthedeliveryapp-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Where can I find guidance on the delivery app?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg