_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen." width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Interested in becoming a courier?</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Download our app to start your application and join our team of over 20,000 couriers currently on the road. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><div class="landing-feature-banner__app-store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/hermes-courier-community/id1568298035" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-button" aria-label="Download on the App Store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&